Confirm authorization before distribution or operational deployment.

Changes in this derivative:

- new package, skin, patch, body-attribute, and loader identifiers;
- a navy traffic-police visual system and Wuhu-specific prototype copy;
- a sidebar brand stage driven by the existing DSH sidebar layout;
- Chinese status projection from the active DSH conversation;
- a fixed hero headline with ownership-safe restoration;
- removal of ORCA artwork, pricing, icon rewriting, composer behavior changes,
  settings overlays, and plugin-specific business UI styling.
